# Raw secret value, one line, no KEY= prefix — password for the dedicated
# uid=dashboard-login,ou=people,... LLDAP bind account
# (modules/dashboard-login.nix), used only to check whether an
# already-authenticated user is a member of the "admins" group (their own
# bind can only ever see their own entry). Generate a real one with:
# openssl rand -hex 16
REPLACE-ME-WITH-A-REAL-SECRET-AT-LEAST-8-CHARS
